{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"NoConvergence"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Power iterations (eigenvector and Katz centrality, PageRank, HITS), Lanczos and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conjugate-gradient runs, and QL eigenvalue iterations throw it. Each throwing method documents"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what it counts as an iteration and what its residual measures. The residual is on the scale of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the tolerance the method compares it with, which is the caller’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance"},{"type":"text","text":" where the method"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes one, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"residual \/ tolerance"},{"type":"text","text":" says how far from convergence the method stopped. It may"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be infinite or NaN when the iteration diverged."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["do throws(NoConvergence) {","    let scores = try graph.pageRank(maxIterations: 20)","    use(scores)","} catch {","    print(\"PageRank stopped after \\(error.iterations) iterations at \\(error.residual)\")","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The error an iterative method throws when it uses up its iteration limit without meeting its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stopping rule."}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"NoConvergence","modules":[{"name":"GraphProtocols"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"NoConvergence"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols